WEBVTT

00:39:57.700 --> 00:40:01.223
We aren't able to benefit from them
as much as others,

00:40:01.247 --> 00:40:04.824
and I wonder whether there will pressure
on that open stance.

00:40:05.382 --> 00:40:07.137
KFL: One could speculate --

00:40:07.161 --> 00:40:09.088
I think, on the one hand,

00:40:09.112 --> 00:40:12.576
the research community
really wants to share.

00:40:12.600 --> 00:40:17.871
They recognize it was through sharing
that got us as far as we got.

00:40:18.403 --> 00:40:23.363
And I think AI researchers
are naturally sharing people in nature.

00:40:23.387 --> 00:40:28.034
On the other hand, there are new rules
coming up in the US,

00:40:28.058 --> 00:40:30.141
such as export control.